01:02:14,700 --> 01:02:15,533
What's up?

1686
01:02:15,533 --> 01:02:16,266
Bro!

1687
01:02:16,833 --> 01:02:19,933
[Busy Tao]

1688
01:02:19,933 --> 01:02:20,566
What's up?

1689
01:02:20,600 --> 01:02:21,500
Someone looking for me?

1690
01:02:22,200 --> 01:02:22,666
Who is it?

1691
01:02:22,666 --> 01:02:23,800
Kong (Kong Xichen).

1692
01:02:23,833 --> 01:02:24,966
She's on the rooftop of the dining hall.

1693
01:02:25,000 --> 01:02:25,666
Is that okay?

1694
01:02:25,666 --> 01:02:26,366
Okay.

1695
01:02:27,433 --> 01:02:28,733
Hi!

1696
01:02:28,733 --> 01:02:29,933
Hi!

1697
01:02:31,666 --> 01:02:32,900
[Where do you stand?]

1698
01:02:33,133 --> 01:02:34,833
[Next Episode]
I voted for you on day one.

1699
01:02:34,866 --> 01:02:35,666
[Next Episode]
What are you thinking?

1700
01:02:35,666 --> 01:02:38,166
[Next Episode]
I'm recalling Autumn's reactions.

1701
01:02:38,200 --> 01:02:39,200
[Next Episode]
Not very good.

1702
01:02:39,200 --> 01:02:40,633
[Next Episode]
Is this how 'complementary' works?

1703
01:02:40,633 --> 01:02:41,700
[Next Episode]
One person's super chatty and outgoing.

1704
01:02:41,700 --> 01:02:42,500
[Next Episode]
The other barely speaks.

1705
01:02:42,500 --> 01:02:43,733
[Going Separate Ways?]
That's a disaster.

1706
01:02:43,733 --> 01:02:44,733
[Going Separate Ways?]
I got you a gift.

1707
01:02:44,733 --> 01:02:46,033
How many boring gifts

1708
01:02:46,066 --> 01:02:47,400
are you planning to give me today?

1709
01:02:47,433 --> 01:02:48,233
It's a surprise.

1710
01:02:48,233 --> 01:02:49,466
Thanks for the surprise.

1711
01:02:49,466 --> 01:02:50,466
Out of all the boys I've talked to,

1712
01:02:50,466 --> 01:02:51,700
the one who feels the most genuine.

1713
01:02:51,700 --> 01:02:53,133
Our personalities are pretty similar.

1714
01:02:53,133 --> 01:02:53,933
You can feel that?

1715
01:02:55,133 --> 01:02:57,866
I feel really comfortable around you.

1716
01:02:57,900 --> 01:02:59,233
Many of us like Susu (Zhang Xuefei).

1717
01:02:59,266 --> 01:02:59,600
Yeah.

1718
01:02:59,633 --> 01:03:00,466
I voted for Man (Man Shuyu)

1719
01:03:00,466 --> 01:03:02,733
because we actually talked today.

1720
01:03:02,733 --> 01:03:03,600
I think what he said

1721
01:03:03,633 --> 01:03:04,266
was a bit abstract,

1722
01:03:04,266 --> 01:03:04,766
and I couldn't get it.

1723
01:03:04,800 --> 01:03:06,233
I think it was interesting.

1724
01:03:06,466 --> 01:03:08,533
Would you mind if your partner
called you childish?

1725
01:03:08,533 --> 01:03:09,800
I think in relationships,

1726
01:03:09,833 --> 01:03:11,066
being a little childish is normal.

1727
01:03:11,066 --> 01:03:12,300
I might change my mind about that someday

1728
01:03:12,300 --> 01:03:13,233
because I haven't seen this before.

1729
01:03:13,266 --> 01:03:14,400
You can change that easily?

1730
01:03:15,066 --> 01:03:16,900
Changing your mind too easily
isn't a good thing.

1731
01:03:16,900 --> 01:03:19,033
It means your thoughts aren't solid.

1732
01:03:19,066 --> 01:03:20,566
And if I already see it as a flaw,

1733
01:03:20,600 --> 01:03:22,133
then it's something I don't like.

1734
01:03:22,133 --> 01:03:24,166
My experience tells me
I'd leave the island.

1735
01:03:24,200 --> 01:03:25,466
I feel the same.

1736
01:03:27,433 --> 01:03:28,300
No one gets me.

1737
01:03:28,300 --> 01:03:29,600
No one understands me.

1738
01:03:29,633 --> 01:03:31,333
[Clash of Perspectives?]
We almost started arguing.

1739
01:03:31,866 --> 01:03:34,200
Do you think I'm the type
who waits around?

1740
01:03:34,733 --> 01:03:37,000
Today, the islanders will
form three-person teams.

1741
01:03:42,700 --> 01:03:43,533
[Affection Diary Preview]
A new boy!

1742
01:03:43,533 --> 01:03:44,766
[Affection Diary Preview]
I'm so curious what he looks like.

1743
01:03:44,800 --> 01:03:46,666
[Affection Diary Preview]
He's a proactive 'catfish' type.

1744
01:03:46,666 --> 01:03:47,500
[Affection Diary Preview]
He looks like a boss.

1745
01:03:47,500 --> 01:03:49,400
[Affection Diary Preview]
He totally fits the 'catfish' mold.

1746
01:03:49,433 --> 01:03:50,900
[Affection Diary Preview]
He's gotta stay calm.

1747
01:03:50,900 --> 01:03:51,966
[Affection Diary Preview]
If he stays with us,

1748
01:03:52,000 --> 01:03:52,800
[Affection Diary Preview]
I'll mess with him.

1749
01:03:52,800 --> 01:03:53,866
[Affection Diary Preview]
That's some serious hostility.

1750
01:03:53,866 --> 01:03:54,866
[Affection Diary Preview]
They're so...

1751
01:03:54,866 --> 01:03:57,100
[Affection Diary Preview]
That's tense.

1752
01:03:57,100 --> 01:03:58,366
My name's Man Shuyu.

1753
01:03:58,400 --> 01:03:59,300
And a new girl?

1754
01:03:59,300 --> 01:04:00,333
Describe me in one word.

1755
01:04:00,533 --> 01:04:01,400
Lin Chi-ling.

1756
01:04:01,433 --> 01:04:03,333
That's a big compliment.

1757
01:04:03,333 --> 01:04:05,033
He's got a sweet tongue.

1758
01:04:05,066 --> 01:04:05,933
You're honored, too,

1759
01:04:05,933 --> 01:04:06,566
to date 'Greg Hsu'.

1760
01:04:06,600 --> 01:04:08,400
Greg Hsu!

1761
01:04:08,400 --> 01:04:09,633
Their energy really matches.

1762
01:04:09,633 --> 01:04:11,500
Totally different storylines.

1763
01:04:14,266 --> 01:04:15,300
[Sweet]
That's sweet.

1764
01:04:15,300 --> 01:04:16,133
[Sweet]
Don't hesitate.

1765
01:04:16,133 --> 01:04:17,600
[Warning]
Don't mess this up, Pan Xiaoyi.

1766
01:04:17,633 --> 01:04:19,566
Can't believe they went all-in.

1767
01:04:19,600 --> 01:04:21,700
I did not see that coming.

1768
01:04:24,700 --> 01:04:25,933
He can't help smiling.

1769
01:04:25,933 --> 01:04:27,233
He's so happy.

1770
01:04:27,266 --> 01:04:27,866
Similar.

1771
01:04:27,866 --> 01:04:29,500
A close friend similar to me.

1772
01:04:29,900 --> 01:04:31,300
Almost lovers?

1773
01:04:31,300 --> 01:04:32,333
It's not romance.

1774
01:04:32,333 --> 01:04:33,566
Use the time I have left

1775
01:04:33,600 --> 01:04:35,200
to get to know you.

1776
01:04:35,200 --> 01:04:36,933
He was touched. He said okay.

1777
01:04:37,000 --> 01:04:38,500
At this point, all he could say was okay.

1778
01:04:38,500 --> 01:04:39,633
[Can't Say No]
At this point, all he could say was okay.

1779
01:04:39,666 --> 01:04:40,966
Iconic scene.

1780
01:04:41,000 --> 01:04:43,633
That's so embarrassing.

1781
01:04:44,633 --> 01:04:45,933
It's over?

1782
01:04:45,933 --> 01:04:47,566
It's hard for Guo Zhentao.
